<Layout title="Offshore staffing for New Zealand businesses" description="Build capacity in your New Zealand business with dedicated offshore staff. iHire manages recruitment, employment and local support in Sri Lanka." crumbs={[{name:'New Zealand offshore staffing',url:'/nz/offshore-staffing/'}]}><PageHero title="Grow your capacity. Keep your team connected." intro="For a New Zealand SME, a hard-to-fill role or an overloaded team can hold back the whole business. Dedicated offshore staffing gives you another way to add capacity while keeping day-to-day direction in your hands."/><section class="section wrap compact-top detail-grid"><div><h2>Start with the work that needs an owner.</h2><p>Inbox management, customer follow-up, catalogue administration and operational coordination can draw time away from a small local team. Define a coherent role around that recurring work, with clear outcomes and a local manager.</p><p>For specialist needs, specify the experience and systems you require. We recruit around the brief, rather than asking you to fit your business into a generic package.</p><h2>Plan the working day.</h2><p>Agree the overlap you need with your New Zealand team, including seasonal changes to local hours. For after-hours monitoring, define escalation contacts and handovers before recruiting.</p><a class="text-link" href="/roles/">Explore roles for your business →</a></div><aside class="surface-panel"><h2>A local relationship. Offshore support.</h2><p>iHire provides a New Zealand-based commercial relationship, with established operations in Sri Lanka. We handle recruitment, employment administration, payroll and the agreed infrastructure.</p><p>You choose the candidate and manage their daily work. Your employee joins your meetings, learns your systems and works to your priorities.</p><a class="text-link" href="/pricing/">Understand the cost factors →</a></aside></section><CTASection/></Layout>
